# Everything stays LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Two things depend on it: the formatting gate enforces `end_of_line = lf`, so a CRLF checkout fails CI on
# a fresh clone, and housekeeper/run.sh must be LF or the add-on container cannot execute it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
housekeeper/run.sh text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
